 "remarks": "A beautifully maintained home with thoughtful updates throughout, this property blends comfort, style, and everyday convenience-especially with the elementary school just a short walk away. The first floor was just recently renovated, and the main level also offers a dedicated office, while the walkup third floor provides a spacious bonus room ideal for flexible living. The heart of the home is a kitchen to die for, complete with a butler's pantry and a cozy fireplace that adds warmth and charm. Outdoor living shines with a welcoming covered front porch and a bluestone patio set within a private fencedin yard. It's a truly moveinready home in a prime location.",
